  "caveats": [
    "Stock master gives NaN prompts for any batch of 32 or more tokens through a loop-core layer whose experts are in RAM with op offload on, including -ot exps=CPU and image prompts. This layout is not affected.",
    "Stock master loads 64k with IQ4_NL and runs out of memory on the first request; use the two patches, or -c 32768.",
    "128k needs the 6-15 layout at ub 64 without op offload.",
    "A layout that loads within about 0.4 GB of the card's limit fails on its first request.",
    "The 2-bit files pass needles and the coding eval; only KLD shows how far they are from the full model."
